h2 { font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 8px; } ul { margin: 4px 0 10px; padding-left: 20px; } li { margin-bottom: 3px; }
</style>
<h2>Asobi 0.8 (build 626)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Everyone in the room is listed everywhere.</b> A seat that joined before you, on any path, now shows in your list of who is here, in the app and on the web page.</li>
<li><b>Your name, asked once.</b> The first time you host or join a review without ever having set a name, Asobi asks for one instead of announcing your Mac&#8217;s account name. Change it any time in Settings.</li>
<li><b>Browsing privately stays private.</b> Someone who joins or reloads while you are browsing privately lands where the room is, not where you are.</li>
<li><b>Past Reviews is always listed</b> in the Shared Review panel, empty or not, and gains a filter once it grows: by session, clip, date, or link.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
